-- Source sales period: 05.10.2026–18.10.2026 (two complete Monday–Sunday weeks).
-- IIKO code mapping source: report dated 07.10.2026.
-- Formula for every weekday: -(week 1 quantity + week 2 quantity) / 2.
-- Empty source cells are treated as zero: the report's per-item total confirms this.
-- Values are rounded to four decimal places, matching the settings UI.
--
-- This is one SQL statement, so it works in the Supabase SQL Editor.
-- It imports only active products with one exact IIKO-code match.
-- Missing or duplicate IIKO codes are skipped and returned in the final result.
